    "result": "Excellent! The fix is in place. The change I made:\n\n**Original code**: Only passed the positional arguments (`args`) to frai-gate, losing flags\n```typescript\nconst result = spawnSync(process.execPath, [gateCli, ...(args ?? [])], { stdio: 'inherit' });\n```\n\n**Fixed code**: Extracts everything after 'gate' from `process.argv`, preserving all flags\n```typescript\nconst gateIndex = process.argv.indexOf('gate');\nconst gateArgs = gateIndex >= 0 ? process.argv.slice(gateIndex + 1) : args ?? [];\nconst result = spawnSync(process.execPath, [gateCli, ...gateArgs], { stdio: 'inherit' });\n```\n\nNow when you run `frai gate init --ci`, all arguments including the `--ci` flag are properly forwarded to the frai-gate CLI, which will correctly create both FRAI-SPEC.md and .github/workflows/rai-gate.yml.",
